  "bodyHash": "NVzmAfLaOEM=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灾厄村民入侵将 Minecraft 的灾厄村民提升到了全新水平！近十种拥有独特能力的新灾厄村民将游荡在你的世界。有些藏身于危险的新建筑中，另一些则加入村庄袭击，使其更加棘手。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">对抗更聪明的敌人，寻找强大的战利品，探索神秘地点。新的挑战意味着新的回报——一路乐趣无穷！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 新灾厄村民</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">炼金术士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：专家弓箭手，被激怒时会投掷滞留药水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">档案管理员</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：用附魔增强附近的灾厄村民。受惊时会逃跑并施法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">重击者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：持盾的恶霸，会向玩家冲锋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠夺者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：远程灾厄村民，投掷致命飞斧——从他那里夺取</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铂金灌注飞斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">挑衅者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用弓的灾厄村民，具备基础增益法术。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">术士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：难以捉摸的施法者，召唤危险的紫色火焰。掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">奇异粉尘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死灵法师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：亡灵大师，通过召唤法术压制玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">审判官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：强大的灾厄村民战士，拥有强力盾牌——先破盾才能击败他！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰召唤者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：看似无害的神秘法师——直到他释放毁灭性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">唤魔者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：最强大的灾厄村民！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神圣宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，用于通过</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">升级附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻术师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：现在以全新外观出现在生存模式！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻影粉尘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 新建筑</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰召唤者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：带农场的小房子。生成于恶地。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灾厄村民堡垒</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：设有墙壁、塔楼和强大灾厄村民的防御工事。生成于针叶林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻术师塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：多层塔楼，遍布灾厄村民，顶层与幻术师对决。生成于针叶林和黑森林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷宫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：巨大的地下迷宫，藏有大量战利品和更多灾厄村民。寻找石庙入口！生成于大多数森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">术士小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：小型房屋建筑。生成于黑森林。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ 新装备与物品</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：突破附魔等级上限！每次使用需要一颗</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神圣宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铂金灌注飞斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可投掷的斧类武器，掠夺者稀有掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">失落之烛</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：帮助定位附近的矿石，揭示其位置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">视界号角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使附近的怪物发光，更快找到它们！</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持，可以通过游戏内的模组菜单直接进行配置（需要安装</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组菜单</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（作者：</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）在 Fabric 上）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需要安装</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有配置文件位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，根据配置类型命名为</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。并非所有类型都会存在于某个模组中，甚至可能完全没有。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 特别感谢</span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他最初创建了出色的灾厄村民扩展模组。灾厄村民入侵是对其作品的忠实延续，并添加了许多新内容、改进、重做和错误修复。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 感谢</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fZekeSmith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他在 Dricky 删除原始灾厄村民扩展源代码后找到了它，使得根据</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspdx.org%252flicenses%252fMIT.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">许可证实现此次移植成为可能。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他参与了灾厄村民扩展 1.19.2 版本的工作，视界号角的纹理取自那里。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他创作了许多精彩的新纹理。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
